OL,3,GNEWSABaby marmoset rescued from shed   
OL,4,Afinds new mum                          
OL,6,FA baby marmoset that was kept in a     
OL,7,Fdirty birdcage with only a lamp for    
OL,8,Fwarmth has been given a new home after 
OL,9,Fbeing rescued by police.               
OL,11,FGino, thought to be five months old,   
OL,12,Fhad been taken from his family to be   
OL,13,Fsold as a pet and was being held in a  
OL,14,Fgarden shed in south London.           
OL,16,FMetropolitan Police officers found him 
OL,17,Fat risk of dying of hypothermia when   
OL,18,Fthey went to the address, and removed  
OL,19,Fhim with help from Monkey World in     
OL,20,FDorset.                                
