OL,3,GNEWSABaby marmoset rescued from shed   
OL,4,Afinds new mum                          
OL,6,FGino, who was named after one of the   
OL,7,Fofficers who led the rescue, is now    
OL,8,Frecovering at the centre, where he has 
OL,9,Fbeen adopted by Minty, an adult female 
OL,10,Fmarmoset.                              
